# data/chroma/ is intentionally NOT ignored: Day 4 ships the pre-built
# vector store committed to git so `git clone && docker build` produces a
# working container without re-running ingestion. See README.md
# ("Deployment notes") and decisions.md for the tradeoff this implies
# (the DB can drift from the corpus/chunking code that produced it if
# either changes without re-ingesting and re-committing).
